wudi:m007-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"玄囂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000010","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m007-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"高辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m007-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"帝嚳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p008","text":"帝嚳高辛者，黃帝之曾孫也。高辛父曰蟜極，蟜極父曰玄囂，玄囂父曰黃帝。自玄囂與蟜極皆不得在位，至高辛即帝位。高辛於顓頊爲族子。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"帝嚳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"高辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"高辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"蟜極","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000016","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"蟜極","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000016","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"玄囂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000010","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"玄囂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000010","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"玄囂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000010","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"蟜極","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000016","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"高辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"高辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m008-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"顓頊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000013","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p009","text":"高辛生而神靈，自言其名。普施利物，不於其身。聰以知遠，明以察微。順天之義，知民之急。仁而威，惠而信，脩身而天下服。取地之財而節用之，撫教萬民而利誨之，曆日月而迎送之，明鬼神而敬事之。其色郁郁，其德嶷嶷。其動也時，其服也士。帝嚳溉執中而徧天下，日月所照，風雨所至，莫不從服。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高辛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m009-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"帝嚳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p010","text":"帝嚳娶陳鋒氏女，生放勳。娶娵訾氏女，生摯。帝嚳崩，而摯代立。帝摯立，不善，崩。而弟放勳立，是爲帝堯。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"帝嚳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"陳鋒氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000017","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"放勳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0013","start":13,"end":17,"surface":"娵訾氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000018","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"摯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000019","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"帝嚳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"摯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000019","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"帝摯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000019","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"放勳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m010-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"帝堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p027","text":"自黃帝至舜、禹，皆同姓而異其國號，以章明德。故黃帝爲有熊，帝顓頊爲高陽，帝嚳爲高辛，帝堯爲陶唐，帝舜爲有虞。帝禹爲夏后而別氏，姓姒氏。契爲商，姓子氏。棄爲周，姓姬氏。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m027-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m027-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m027-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m027-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m027-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"有熊","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"可能為個人、官職、群體、氏族或國號；不憑本篇未明示的外部對應補造身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m027-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"帝顓頊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000013","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m027-0033","start":33,"end":35,"s