i-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p001","text":"殷契，母曰簡狄，有娀氏之女，為帝嚳次妃。三人行浴，見玄鳥墮其卵，簡狄取吞之，因孕生契。契長而佐禹治水有功。帝舜乃命契曰：「百姓不親，五品不訓，汝為司徒而敬敷五教，五教在寬。」封于商，賜姓子氏。契興於唐、虞、大禹之際，功業著於百姓，百姓以平。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"殷契","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000045","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"簡狄","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000080","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"有娀氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"帝嚳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"簡狄","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000080","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"契","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000045","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"契","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000045","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"帝舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"契","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000045","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"契","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000045","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0099","start":99,"end":102,"surface":"唐、虞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m001-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"大禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p001","text":"周后稷，名棄。其母有邰氏女，曰姜原。姜原為帝嚳元妃。姜原出野，見巨人跡，心忻然說，欲踐之，踐之而身動如孕者。居期而生子，以為不祥，棄之隘巷，馬牛過者皆辟不踐；徙置之林中，適會山林多人，遷之；而棄渠中冰上，飛鳥以其翼覆薦之。姜原以為神，遂收養長之。初欲棄之，因名曰棄。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"周后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"棄","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"有邰氏女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"姜原","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000159","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"姜原","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000159","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"帝嚳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000015","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"姜原","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000159","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"巨人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"姜原","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000159","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m001-0131","start":131,"end":132,"surface":"棄","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p001","text":"楚之先祖出自帝顓頊髙陽。髙陽者，黃帝之孫，昌意之子也。髙陽生稱，稱生巻章，巻章生重黎。重黎爲帝嚳髙辛居火正，甚有功，能光融天下，帝嚳命曰祝融。共工氏作亂，帝嚳使重黎誅之而不盡。帝乃以庚寅日誅重黎，而以其弟呉回爲重黎後，復居火正，爲祝融。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"帝顓頊髙陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000013","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"髙陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000013","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"昌意","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000011","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"髙陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000013","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"稱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001843","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"稱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001843","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"巻章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001844","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"巻章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001844","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"重黎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001841","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"重黎","kind":"person","person_id":"cb